<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia April inflation rises to 8.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovenia April inflation rises to 8.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday.</p>
<p>RETAIL PRICE INFLATION</p>
<p>    (changes in percent)	    April     March    April 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	    2.0	 0.3	1.2</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change		8.2	 7.4     10.7</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
